38513>>>    Procedure SetActionButtons
38516>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38516>>>        tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38516>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
38516>>>        Handle hoDD
38516>>>
38516>>>        Get Server to hoDD
38517>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38518>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
38519>>>
38519>>>        // let's hide all buttons and then Show the ones we want
38519>>>        WebSet pbRender of oEditBtn to False
